<title>TURKEY: SOCCER-BELGIUM BEAT TURKEY 2-1 IN U-21 EUROPEAN QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BELGIUM BEAT TURKEY 2-1 IN U-21 EUROPEAN QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium beat Turkey 2-1 (halftime 2-0) in a European under-21 soccer championship group seven qualifier on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Belgium - Peter Van Houdt 22, 38.</p>
<p>Turkey - Murat Sozkesen 90.</p>
<p>Attendance: 2,000.</p>
</text>
